#: ../../simulator/config.md:8 8133d56083724e69a91bc55b3eb0dd9d
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuration"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:10 19271e3461d34357848570b8d87aba4f
msgid "Launch modes"
msgstr "Mode de lancements"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:12 5ca9824a15dd46a18ecf685f8e1385c1
msgid "There are 4 launch modes:"
msgstr "Il existe 4 modes de lancement :"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:13 ../../simulator/config.md:35
#: 45c0191614d84ac6a9371658a71ce11e a38b65d98f584d8cb4977eabf01d3685
msgid "Load Flow (LF)"
msgstr "Load Flow (LF)"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:14 ../../simulator/config.md:44
#: 24f5cd7e260e4e2a8d9ef70b992a652b d5bb5bc0e5b440429ab0810282bce8ef
msgid "Optimal Power Load Flow without redispatching (OPF w/o redispatching)"
msgstr "Optimal Power Load Flow sans redispatching (OPF w/o redispatching)"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:15 ../../simulator/config.md:61
#: 7e221220b07549889a52c9bb69c6c966 f5098facf96a49dca885cb1f9807a2bc
msgid "Optimal Power Load Flow (OPF)"
msgstr "Optimal Power Load Flow (OPF)"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:16 ../../simulator/config.md:66
#: 0ff155e531fb473596530df8b26ba8aa b342c423dd0a4a0ba95b6a4de2dd258b
msgid "Optimal Power Load Flow with overload (OPF with overload)"
msgstr "Optimal Power Load Flow avec surcharge (OPF with overload)"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:18 952af30a77a84136b3be4b2fec39ab5d
msgid "For all these modes, the first steps are:"
msgstr "Pour tous ces modes, les premières étapes sont :"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:19 75d8050d49454b2a9cbc25a8c431f412
msgid "building the Jacobian matrix and its LU factorization"
msgstr "construction de la jacobienne et factorisation LU de cette dernière"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:20 a15e69ff3e3c47a8a813056854ca8971
msgid "for each variant:"
msgstr "pour chacune des variantes :"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:21 f654919b049544fcab630d9e7fb65613
msgid "updating the network topology"
msgstr "mise à jour de la topologie réseau"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:22 ae74e5eb95754b6aa7cf49f4c5db7826
msgid "updating the Jacobian matrix"
msgstr "mise à jour de la jacobienne"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:23 e9f497d82d5a4124bba53a3512fd5caf
msgid "refactorizing the Jacobian matrix"
msgstr "refactorisation de la jacobienne"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:24 7bc91cc4545b4a93acc4436b09005c1a
msgid "computing the LODFs and PTDFs"
msgstr "calculs LODFs et PTDFs"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:26 d92c1c7aef2249419e382ac28586a081
msgid "The different types of constraints are:"
msgstr "Les différents types de contraintes sont :"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:27 65c1a801174343c4bb8c67562b569aa2
msgid "`CONTRAINTE_EMUL_AC_N = 1`: N constraint on a fictitious quadripole"
msgstr "`CONTRAINTE_EMUL_AC_N = 1` : contrainte en N sur un quadripôle fictif"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:28 accfa5f865e54938957c09c4e239d508
msgid ""
"`CONTRAINTE_EMULATION_AC = 2`: N-k constraint on a fictitious quadripole"
msgstr ""
"`CONTRAINTE_EMULATION_AC = 2` : contrainte en N-k sur un quadripôle fictif"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:29 7c8dae6b6e684c639eb5cf8002afaae9
msgid "`CONTRAINTE_N = 3`: N constraint on a non-fictitious quadripole"
msgstr "`CONTRAINTE_N = 3` : contrainte en N sur un quadripôle non-fictif"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:30 9e726ee0eee94182be0ced2c2377f2a1
msgid ""
"`CONTRAINTE_N_MOINS_K = 4`: N-k constraint on a non-fictitious quadripole"
msgstr ""
"`CONTRAINTE_N_MOINS_K = 4` : contrainte en N-k sur un quadripôle non-fictif"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:31 64fdb5bd287c482aab31c10cc302dcf3
msgid "`CONTRAINTE_PARADE = 5`: constraint on a remedial action"
msgstr "`CONTRAINTE_PARADE = 5` : contrainte sur une parade"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:32 8d7ec6487dc648e29f7285ed30bdaa25
msgid "`CONTRAINTE_ACTIVATION = 6`: remedial action activation constraint"
msgstr "`CONTRAINTE_ACTIVATION = 6` : contrainte d'activation d'une parade"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:33 814c098dc13f42f4b0a4a69df322eaa3
msgid "`CONTRAINTE_NON_DEF = -1`: undefined constraint"
msgstr "`CONTRAINTE_NON_DEF = -1` : contrainte non définie"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:36 aa87a0508f39435faf01c94f04e3ebd6
msgid ""
"Basic network simulation mode with fixed generation and load. Metrix then "
"returns the flow on the network lines. For this mode: `MODECALC = 1`."
msgstr ""
"Mode basique de simulation réseau avec des productions et consommations "
"fixes. Metrix retourne alors le flot sur les lignes du réseau. Pour ce mode "
": `MODECALC = 1`."

#: ../../simulator/config.md:39 ../../simulator/config.md:50
#: 19271e3461d34357848570b8d87aba4f ea4c036b518c4cfba6e51595d056a1d1
msgid "In this mode:"
msgstr "Dans ce mode :"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:40 881c345d4bee4892a85339d868b3b6f1
msgid "Remedial actions are not read"
msgstr "Les parades ne sont pas lues"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:41 ab1332a3d25546db940a0fdd1f3871d9
msgid ""
"If generators or loads are declared as available for curative actions, they "
"are ignored"
msgstr ""
"Si des groupes ou consommateurs sont renseignés comme étant disponibles pour"
" le curatif, alors ils sont ignorés"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:42 f2ccbeb06fee4b22a9c13c8058509e14
msgid "There is no constraint detection phase"
msgstr "Il n'y a pas de phase de détection de contraintes"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:45 fb83f1138de1432ab2d3ef24ba6e5143
msgid ""
"This mode does not allow Metrix-simulator to perform redispatching "
"(modifying injections and loads) but it tends to minimize the violations of "
"the various constraints by using topological remedial actions, by modifying "
"the phase shifts of the phase tap changers, or by modifying the flows on the"
" HVDC lines. For this mode: `MODECALC = 2`."
msgstr ""
"Ce mode ne permet pas à Metrix-simulator de faire du redispatching (modifier"
" les injections et consommations) mais il tend à minimiser les violations "
"des différentes contraintes grâce à l'utilisation de parades topologiques, "
"de modifications des déphasages des transformateurs-déphaseurs ou encore de "
"modifications des flux sur les lignes à courant continu. Pour ce mode : "
"`MODECALC = 2`."

#: ../../simulator/config.md:51 2eddc5c9e8544f1abe9e93fa64981f3f
msgid "If a generator is declared as available for redispatching:"
msgstr "Si un groupe est indiqué comme disponible pour le redispatching :"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:52 dc67e503e9014602bf0eeaec32f89122
msgid ""
"and only for redispatching (i.e. `OUI_AR`), then it is considered as "
"available neither for redispatching nor for adequacy (i.e. `NON_HR_AR`)"
msgstr ""
"et uniquement pour le redispatching (i.e. `OUI_AR`), alors il est considéré "
"comme n'étant pas disponible ni pour le redispatching ni pour l'adequacy "
"(i.e. `NON_HR_AR`)"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:54 75fb95be716b4e2dbdecdfe1aed4152b
msgid ""
"but also for adequacy (i.e. `OUI_HR_AR`), then it is considered as available"
" only for adequacy (i.e. `OUI_HR`)"
msgstr ""
"mais aussi pour l'adequacy (i.e. `OUI_HR_AR`), alors il est considéré comme "
"étant uniquement disponible pour l'adequacy (i.e. `OUI_HR`)"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:56 46786d120e0b49e092ce6c0395ca3f14
msgid ""
"If generators are declared as available for curative actions, they are "
"ignored"
msgstr ""
"Si des groupes sont renseignés comme étant disponibles pour le curatif, "
"alors ils sont ignorés"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:57 6a500463c36444288ac2357fafe74555
msgid ""
"Loss of load is forbidden here (i.e. the load variation variables are fixed "
"and ???)"
msgstr ""
"Les défaillances sont interdites ici (i.e. les variables de variations de "
"consommation sont fixes et ???)"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:58 80262ed727714aa5b2d138ed0f01d918
msgid ""
"Slack variables are added for every constraint with a type other than "
"`CONTRAINTE_EMUL_AC_N`, `CONTRAINTE_EMULATION_AC` or "
"`CONTRAINTE_ACTIVATION`."
msgstr ""
"Des variables d'écart sont ajoutées pour toute contrainte avec un type autre"
" que `CONTRAINTE_EMUL_AC_N`, `CONTRAINTE_EMULATION_AC` ou "
"`CONTRAINTE_ACTIVATION`."

#: ../../simulator/config.md:62 6feaab19b4864ebe8fbed7ef89e803c3
msgid ""
"This mode can use all possible actions (redispatching in addition to the "
"actions described in the previous chapter) in order to minimize, at the "
"lowest cost, the constraint violations. For this mode: `MODECALC = 0`."
msgstr ""
"Ce mode a la possibilité toutes les actions possibles (redispatching en plus"
" des actions énoncées dans le chapitre précédent) afin de minimiser, à "
"moindre coût, les violations des contraintes. Pour ce mode : `MODECALC = 0`."

#: ../../simulator/config.md:67 88900c21fef84cbcadd2b25e0e4aa27a
msgid ""
"This mode works like the previous one; however, if no solution is found the "
"program does not return an error, but results with overload. For this mode: "
"`MODECALC = 3`."
msgstr ""
"Ce mode fonctionne comme le précédent, toutefois si aucune solution n'est "
"trouvée le programme ne retourne pas d'erreur, mais des résultats avec "
"surcharge. Pour ce mode : `MODECALC = 3`."

#: ../../simulator/config.md:71 5b64007d926249f9a468ac01f15dc75d
msgid ""
"If loads are declared as available for curative actions, they are ignored. "
"There are no coupling constraints here. Slack variables are added for every "
"constraint with a type other than `CONTRAINTE_EMUL_AC_N`, "
"`CONTRAINTE_EMULATION_AC` or `CONTRAINTE_ACTIVATION`."
msgstr ""
"Si des consommateurs sont renseignés comme étant disponibles pour le "
"curatif, alors ils sont ignorés. Il n'y a pas de contraintes de couplage "
"ici. Des variables d'écart sont ajoutées pour toute contrainte avec un type "
"autre que `CONTRAINTE_EMUL_AC_N`, `CONTRAINTE_EMULATION_AC` ou "
"`CONTRAINTE_ACTIVATION`."

#: ../../simulator/config.md:75 f9f7203ea4bf4d98b26b9aad25183c3c
msgid "PTDF file generation"
msgstr "Générations fichiers PTDFs"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:77 66d2837c288642a5a32b86b10f8e3740
msgid ""
"The files are generated by calling the simulator. For the moment, it is not "
"possible to generate only the PTDF files for each variant without running a "
"resolution. However, there is, a priori, no reason why this could not be "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"La génération des fichiers se fait via l'appel au simulateur. Il n'est pour "
"l'instant pas possible d'uniquement générer les fichiers PTDFs pour chacune "
"des variantes sans lancer de résolution. Toutefois, il n'y a, a priori, pas "
"de raison à ce que cela ne soit pas possible."

#: ../../simulator/config.md:81 baa530e392ff4ccf993e468faf30ed0d
msgid "Return codes and crash handling"
msgstr "Codes de retour et gestion des crashs"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:83 7effbe228c044cac8276a9a12acc98bd
msgid "The different return statuses are as follows:"
msgstr "Les diférents status de retour sont les suivants :"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:84 d7564bf6f8704e23a67823b9e7648977
msgid "`METRIX_PROBLEME = -1`: KO"
msgstr "`METRIX_PROBLEME = -1` : KO"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:85 b93adc88fc1a4fb6b0167a7429830ab4
msgid "`METRIX_PAS_PROBLEME = 0`: OK"
msgstr "`METRIX_PAS_PROBLEME = 0` : OK"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:86 713119b13ed84753aa164d5a5f0165d7
msgid "`METRIX_PAS_SOLUTION = 1`: infeasible problem or no solution found"
msgstr ""
"`METRIX_PAS_SOLUTION = 1` : problème infaisable ou pas de solution trouvée"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:87 2c614fa3c7984b14883c980c50fcd777
msgid ""
"`METRIX_NB_MAX_CONT_ATTEINT = 2`: maximum number of added constraints "
"reached"
msgstr ""
"`METRIX_NB_MAX_CONT_ATTEINT = 2` : nombre maximum de contraintes ajoutées "
"atteint"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:88 3d88277c3c594129a5c8d2a1af07d2a5
msgid "`METRIX_NB_MICROIT = 3`: maximum number of micro-iterations reached"
msgstr "`METRIX_NB_MICROIT = 3` : nombre maximum de micro-iterations atteint"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:89 607431b71a6e440ea384ca97e583e899
msgid "`METRIX_VARIANTE_IGNOREE = 4`: variant ignored"
msgstr "`METRIX_VARIANTE_IGNOREE = 4` : variante ignorée"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:90 14d87120ed5542aab7f4ea138d1a3a0f
msgid ""
"`METRIX_CONTRAINTE_IGNOREE = 3`: constraint ignored, because it is "
"equivalent, Tmax is not defined or no action is possible (in the case of an "
"OPF without redispatching or an OPF with overload)"
msgstr ""
"`METRIX_CONTRAINTE_IGNOREE = 3` : contrainte ignorée, car équivalente, Tmax "
"non défini ou pas d'action possible (dans le cas d'un OPF sans redispatching"
" ou d'un OPF avec surcharge)"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:93 d7799e48e07e42a89cb60d8d9655038f
msgid "Topological remedial action in N"
msgstr "Parade topologique en N"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:95 e3df12e4c60447299583e8ead0e5dfa0
msgid ""
"Using topological remedial actions in N is theoretically not possible. "
"However, the behavior of a topological remedial action in N can be "
"approximated by using a topological remedial action on an element very far "
"from the study area."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisation de parades topologiques en N n'est théoriquement pas possible."
" Toutefois, il est possible d'approcher le comportement de l'utilisation "
"d'une parade topologique en N via une parade topologique sur un élément très"
" éloigné de la zone d'étude."

#: ../../simulator/config.md:97 0e69557cde9047f1b69dfc0d10046439
msgid "ITAM thresholds"
msgstr "Seuils ITAM"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:99 9ef41bc6d37e4fa3ade383ccb5a6eed9
msgid ""
"The tool can be configured to use the pre-switching thresholds (i.e. post-"
"contingency, but before curative actions) via the `TESTITAM` parameter. If "
"these thresholds are enabled, a \"do nothing\" remedial action is added on "
"contingencies with curative actions but without remedial actions."
msgstr ""
"Il est possible de paramétrer l'outil afin d'utiliser les seuils avant "
"manœuvre (i.e. post incident, mais avant curatif) via le paramètre "
"`TESTITAM`. Si ces seuils sont activés, une parade \"ne rien faire\" est "
"ajoutée sur les incidents avec curatif, mais sans parade."

#: ../../simulator/config.md:103 060ad10068514908aabea341e9e96920
msgid "LF+ context"
msgstr "Contexte LF+"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:104 4105ad0ae9bb4ca79c5b5e12ecec532f
msgid ""
"In LF+, when an ITAM threshold is exceeded before the curative topological "
"remedial actions are used, there is no alert or indicator showing this "
"overload. Yet the returned solution may recommend using curative remedial "
"actions that potentially help comply with the ITAM thresholds according to "
"the final logs."
msgstr ""
"En LF+, lorsqu'il y a dépassement d'un seuil ITAM avant utilisation des "
"parades topologiques curatives, il n'y a pas d'alerte ou d'indicateur "
"indiquant ce dépassement. Alors que la solution retournée peut préconiser "
"l'utilisation de parades curatives qui favorisent, potentiellement, le "
"respect des seuils ITAM d'après les logs finaux."

#: ../../simulator/config.md:108 9119e7f2916247b1b94341d79708539f
msgid ""
"This behavior is not realistic since, in a real situation, curative remedial"
" actions do not have time to be activated in order to comply with these ITAM"
" thresholds."
msgstr ""
"Ce comportement n'est pas réaliste puisqu'en situation réelle, les parades "
"curatives n'ont pas le temps d'être activée afin de respecter ces seuils "
"ITAM."

#: ../../simulator/config.md:111 f051ab62869041f69571920e425352f5
msgid "Issue"
msgstr "Problématique"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:112 12e3401c100c4591b4c42bfaf732f0ce
msgid ""
"Metrix solves the problem through global optimization. In other words, it "
"tries to find an optimal solution that satisfies all the constraints while "
"minimizing all the defined objectives (e.g. minimization of overloads in "
"LF+). This implies that, from Metrix's point of view, the minimization of "
"overloads is done \"all at once\" and not sequentially as might be the case "
"manually. Thus, at the output of Metrix, it may consider that there is no "
"more overload while it is the curative remedial actions that make it "
"possible to comply with the ITAM thresholds (not realistic according to the "
"previous paragraph)."
msgstr ""
"Metrix résout le problème via de l'optimisation globale. Autrement dit, ce "
"dernier tente de trouver une solution optimale respectant l'ensemble des "
"contraintes tout en minimisant l'ensemble des objectifs définis (ex : "
"minimisation des dépassements en LF+). Ceci implique que, du point de vue de"
" Metrix, la minimisation des dépassements se fait « d'un coup » et non pas "
"séquentiellement comme ce pourrait être le cas manuellement. Ainsi, en "
"sortie de Metrix, ce dernier peut considérer qu'il n'y a plus de dépassement"
" alors que ce sont des parades curatives qui permettent de respecter les "
"seuils ITAM (non réaliste d'après le paragraphe précédent)."

#: ../../simulator/config.md:120 135ae7bf848344fe8bb4ffd9c33ba8b8
msgid "Possible options:"
msgstr "Options possibles :"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:122 2120c8ca15564ddb9e634c2cd8d7c824
msgid "Use the \"tmp\" files to raise an alert"
msgstr "Utiliser les fichiers « tmp » afin de lever une alerte"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:123 59623a50438d45f0bd6e8fdf81998615
msgid ""
"Modify the model so that only the curative topological remedial actions that"
" have no impact on the elements with exceeded ITAM thresholds can be "
"activated (this solution seems complex to implement a priori)"
msgstr ""
"Modifier le modèle afin que seules les parades topologiques curatives "
"n'ayant pas d'impact sur les éléments avec dépassements de leur seuil ITAM "
"soient activables (cette solution semble complexe à implémenter a priori)"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:125 a2c96faafdeb4769956fa4871bd2d5e6
msgid ""
"For any element with an N-k threshold and an ITAM threshold but no "
"preventive remedial action for this element: remove the N-k thresholds of "
"this element?"
msgstr ""
"Pour tout élément avec un seuil N-k ainsi qu'un seuil ITAM mais pas de "
"parade préventive pour cet élément : suppression de seuils N-k de cet "
"élément ?"

#: ../../simulator/config.md:128 128a58e4dd744745b0eaac862bfc6da9
msgid ""
"Given the LF+ paradigm (minimization of the overloads of different "
"thresholds for the same element and global optimization), the most realistic"
" process seems to be to raise an alert/warning indicating that a threshold "
"is not respected."
msgstr ""
"Compte tenu du paradigme LF+ (minimisation des dépassements de différents "
"seuils pour un même élément et optimisation globale), le process le plus "
"réaliste semble être de lever une alerte/warning indiquant qu'un seuil n'est"
" pas respecté."
